    "description": "Natural Geode Specimens\nSet of Two Quartz Crystal Formations\nNatural Mineral Specimen\nTotal Weight: 5.14 lbs\nUnsigned\nThis pair of natural geode specimens features prominent internal crystalline structures characteristic of quartz formations. The larger, more rounded piece showcases a deep cavity lined with translucent to opaque white crystals, while the second piece displays a more open, heart-shaped configuration. Both specimens retain their natural, rough exterior matrix, providing a striking contrast between the rugged outer shell and the delicate crystalline interior.\nRounder geode measures approximately 6.25\" x 4.25\" x 4\"\nAuthentic mineral specimens with natural crystalline sparkle and textural variety\nIdeal for geological study, home decor display, or as a natural history collectible\nTotal combined weight of 5.14 lbs as measured on a digital scale\nCondition:\nGood natural condition. Both pieces exhibit natural residue and geological imperfections consistent with authentic mineral specimens. Surfaces are stable but possess the inherent irregularities of raw earth materials.",
